<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Forgot Password</title>
    <style>
      body{ font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background: #f7f7f7; color: #333;}
      .container{ max-width: 500px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 30px; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);}
      .otp{ display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background: #f0f4ff; color: #007bff; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 8px; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 20px;}
      .footer{ margin-top: 30px; font-size: 12px; color: #888;}
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h2> Password Reset Request</h2>
      <p>Hello <%= name %>, We received a request to reset your password.</p>
      <p>Use the Otp below to reset your password:</p>
      <div class="otp"><%= OTP %></div>
      <p>This OTP will expire in <%= expirationMinutes %> minutes. If you didn't request this, please ignore this email.</p>
      <div class="footer">&copy; Emergency Ambulance Dispatch System. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
